// IntroString :
"P1173461740" "Invention Enhancements are a brand new type of Enhancement that you make.  They are like traditional Enhancements, but with better bonuses.  They can be slotted at three levels higher than yours, but they cannot be combined with other Enhancements. <br><br> Are you reading me so far, recruit?  Can I get a yes, SIR!  Okay!  Invention Enhancements do not expire as you level.  Their effectiveness is constant and based on the level of the Recipe.<br><br>Straighten those shoulders!  This is not a barn and you will not treat it as one.<br><br>There are even new 'sets' of Invention Enhancements.  Individual Enhancements make up these sets and they work like normal Invention Enhancements, but as you gather and slot your single Power within this 'set', it grants you bonuses.  If you get the entire 'set', you receive maximum bonus.  This is at any level.  We are done here.  <br><br>Do you understand?  The only appropriate response is Sir!  Yes, Sir!<br><br>Now!  You will go sift through those brown Storage Cylinders!  You will see my instructions and Invention Enhancement samples! <br><br> You will NOT detour and dawdle.  You will NOT touch anything other than those storage cylinders.  You WILL come back when you are done.  DO I MAKE MYSELF CLEAR?!"
// AcceptString :
"P2203941838" "Read Invention Enhancement Information"
